<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document appearance */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2 { font-weight: bold; }
  .header-logo { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .logo-text { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 14pt; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: normal; }
  .form-group input[type="text"] { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 100%; padding: 2px 0; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <div class="logo-text">LIBERTY</div>
    <div class="logo-text" style="font-size: 18pt;">UNIVERSITY.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Request for FNIS</div>

  <p>All international students must complete our web-based nonresident information database known as FNIS.</p>

  <p>After completing this form, you will receive an email within 7 to 10 business days to help you log on to our Foreign National Information System (FNIS) website and complete your personal and visa information history.</p>

  <p>Forward this completed form to the Liberty University Human Resources, International Specialist <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>, <span data-field="employer.address">{{ employer.address }}</span> or fax to <span data-field="employer.phone">{{ employer.phone }}</span>, you can also email the information requested below to <span data-field="employer.email">{{ employer.email }}</span>.</p>

  <p>If you have any questions, please call the Human Resources Office at <span data-field="hr_phone">{{ hr_phone }}</span>.</p>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="full_name">First Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="full_name" data-field="full_name" value="{{ full_name }}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="last_name">Last Name</label>
    <input type="text" id="last_name" data-field="last_name" value="{{ last_name }}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="lu_email">LU E-mail Address</label>
    <input type="text" id="lu_email" data-field="lu_email" value="{{ lu_email }}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="alternate_email">Alternate E-mail Address</label>
    <input type="text" id="alternate_email" data-field="alternate_email" value="{{ alternate_email }}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="date_of_birth">Date of birth</label>
    <input type="text" id="date_of_birth" data-field="date_of_birth" value="{{ date_of_birth }}">
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label for="university_id">University ID#</label>
    <input type="text" id="university_id" data-field="university_id" value="{{ university_id }}">
  </div>
</div>